<title>CANADA: Numac to acquire Smart On for C$51 mln.</title>
<headline>Numac to acquire Smart On for C$51 mln.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Numac Energy Inc said on Thursday it has agreed in principle to acqiure all outstanding shares of Smart On Resources Inc in a C$51 million deal.</p>
<p>The purchase consists of C$30.4 million cash and assumption of Smart On debt and the balance through issuance of Numac common shares valued at C$6.03 each, Numac said.</p>
<p>Numac approved the transaction on the recommendation of a special committee of independent directors.  Closing is scheduled for November, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
